There is NO fetch / React-Query / Promise, hence NO loading|error|stale|offline
branch to reproduce (nothing to fetch, fail, age, or lose connectivity to).
Inventing such chrome would fabricate states the source lacks. The REAL branches —
reproduced and tested in full — are the three densities (iconOnly / compact /
expanded = the native peer of `iconOnly` × the `xl:` breakpoint) crossed with the
three shortcuts/tour/feedback affordances. Same disposition as the merged sibling
pure primitive HelpIcon (0215).

